* 2\) Patients are diagnosed with cerebral small vessel disease, and neuroimaging shows new subcortical lacunar infarction (in line with one of the following):

① MRI examination Diffusion-weighted imaging (DWI) phase shows high signal intensity \[Apparent Diffusion Coefficient (ADC) diffusion restriction\] lesions \ 50% by Transcranial Doppler (TCD);
