6. Abnormal renal function (serum creatinine \>1.5 times the upper limit of normal range or estimated eGFR \ 3 times the upper limit of normal range as measured within the past 30 days and determined to be non-transient through repeat testing;
10. Pregnancy, breastfeeding, or women of childbearing potential who are not using an effective method of contraception;
